OL,3,GNEWSARoad that melted to close for
OL,4,Ainvestigation works
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of road that has repeatedly
OL,7,Fmelted will be closed overnight as
OL,8,Fspecialists take samples to understand
OL,9,Fthe reason behind the deterioration.
OL,11,FThe A143 between the villages of
OL,12,FIxworth and Stanton, which is
OL,13,Fnorth-east of Bury St Edmunds in
OL,14,FSuffolk, was closed for urgent repair
OL,15,Fwork in July.
OL,17,FIt faced further issues in October with
OL,18,Fpotholes appearing, and now Suffolk
OL,19,FHighways said the road would close at
OL,20,F19:00 until 05:00 GMT on Thursday for
OL,21,Finvestigations.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
